error[E0602]: a value of type AtomicInt64 is not transferable, so it cannot be given to a parallel item
 --> $DIR/handle-parallel-item.nra:9:13
  |
9 | ...  let _ = parallel.map<atomics.AtomicInt64, int64>(counters, bump, parallel.limits(1000, 1...
  |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ not transferable
  |
  = note: tasks share a Std.Concurrent handle, but a parallel item runs in a heap of its own and receives copies, so a handle cannot enter one

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0602`.
